 "name_en": "Physical Inventory – Inventory Count and Adjustment (BML)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Physical Inventory – Inventory Count and Adjustment (BML)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process begins with the generation of the required inventory count sheets. Materials can be blocked here for posting during the physical inventory. Once the inventory sheets are printed out, the actual physical inventory count is realized for the given materials. The count result is entered in the system and discrepancies in the system quantities are reviewed. The inventory may be recounted until final counts are accepted and inventory differences are posted.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create physical inventory documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print physical inventory documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute physical count or recount</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter physical count</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">List and post physical count differences</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get a transparent view on the stocks currently available</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process inventory adjustments efficiently</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>实际库存 - 库存盘点和调整 (BML)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该流程从生成所需的库存盘点单开始。可在此处冻结物料以在库存盘点期间过账。打印出库存表后，即可实现给定物料的实际库存盘点。盘点结果输入到系统中，并检查系统数量中的差异。在接受最终盘点并过账库存差异之前，可以重新盘点库存。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建库存盘点凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印库存盘点凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行库存盘点或重新盘点</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">输入实际盘点</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">列出并过账库存盘点差异</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio05e848ebc23b4d6fbedd73993c35063f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获取当前可用库存的透明视图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">高效处理库存调整</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
